Project: Eigen, template library for linear algebra: matrices, vectors, numerical solvers, and related algorithms
URL: https://eigen.tuxfamily.org/
Repository: https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen
License: MPL2
Upstream version: 3.4.0
Local modifications: none

The tree under Eigen/ is upstream 3.4.0 with the per-directory CMakeLists.txt
files removed, nothing else. Run eigen-update.sh to refresh it.

Earlier revisions were taken from Blender's extern/ folder and carried a
patches/blender.diff plus a note about an OpenMP fix for MSVC2015. Neither was
present in the tree: comparing the vendored 3.3.7 against upstream 3.3.7 found
no differing file, and the patch did not apply to that version either. Both
have been dropped rather than carried forward as something they were not.
